och8\/fiesta_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And in the middle have a photo holder similar to this (I am in the middle of making them) hold up our table names (events from when we have been together such as: graduation, engagement, trips, College Days, Love at first site) and pictures of those times. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/bird-holder.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Finally there will be tea lights all around that. I have an image in my head I hope it all comes out right!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Where did you order the maracas from?? That&#039;s such a great idea!","Attachments":[],"Id":941797,"PostDate":1259344227,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>alkoch<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">Well I don't have pics yet but here is my idea: <br \/> <br \/> Have the Mexican blanket\/serape as a table runner:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/images.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to 