Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":895,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1900169,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1436533034,"LastPoster":{"Id":282964,"Name":"samwillow","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282964.jpg?_r=1431149209","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":43,"Preview":{"Id":1900169,"PostDate":1436533034,"PostContent":"Hey all, \u00a0 Just wanted to share with everyone - I order some real-touch flowers on Afloral for a...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisesutherland@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.88.106.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424110087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsntobe","Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"32.211.202.237","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7be7c2f242764a77d3906993baa20a08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey all,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Just wanted to share with everyone - I order some real-touch flowers on Afloral for a closeout price. &amp;nbsp;The flowers are AMAZING! &amp;nbsp;They look fantastic and truly are real-touch. &amp;nbsp;I unfortunately received a few that were ripped (it happens with shipping) and the team at Afloral were great. &amp;nbsp;I sent them a photo of the 4 ripped flowers, and unfortunately they are out of the closeout flowers. &amp;nbsp;They offered to send me a dozen other flowers that will match soon-to-be bouquets to make up for it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We always spend time complaining about service, but I wanted to make sure we also talk about the good stuff when it happens! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900169,"PostDate":1436533034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey all,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just wanted to share with everyone - I order some real-touch flowers on Afloral for a closeout price. \u00a0The flowers are AMAZING! \u00a0They look fantastic and truly are real-touch. \u00a0I unfortunately received a few that were ripped (it happens with shipping) and the team at Afloral were great. \u00a0I sent them a photo of the 4 ripped flowers, and unfortunately they are out of the closeout flowers. \u00a0They offered to send me a dozen other flowers that will match soon-to-be bouquets to make up for it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We always spend time complaining about service, but I wanted to make sure we also talk about the good stuff when it happens! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisesutherland@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.88.106.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424110087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsntobe","Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"957e6b1862d88a4b7cf0ecd58991421c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mrsntobe\"] Thank you so much for sharing this info. I have been back and forth with the idea of real touch or not. Would you mind sharing a photo of your flowers with us?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900175,"PostDate":1436537770,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282134\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282134-mrsntobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mrsntobe<\/span><\/a> Thank you so much for sharing this info. I have been back and forth with the idea of real touch or not. Would you mind sharing a photo of your flowers with us?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eecac8fe0ec5a06b038986ea8280bbb0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Mrsntobe&amp;nbsp; Thanks so much for sharing something positive. You&#039;re right - we do spend so much time complaining about the lack of service on things that we do forget to praise those that provide good service! That&#039;s for the gentle reminder!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m glad they came through for you. Flowers can be pretty important to your overall look and vision so the fact that they were willing to make sure you&#039;re happy is big. As well it&#039;s something good for other brides to know!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900177,"PostDate":1436539116,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Mrsntobe\u00a0 Thanks so much for sharing something positive. You're right - we do spend so much time complaining about the lack of service on things that we do forget to praise those that provide good service! That's for the gentle reminder!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm glad they came through for you. Flowers can be pretty important to your overall look and vision so the fact that they were willing to make sure you're happy is big. As well it's something good for other brides to know!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"32.211.202.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Mrsntobe, 10 July 2015 - 02:50 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1436539840,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c4cff885dc2f26d649c2db38781ec665","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;HI ladies,&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;I hope this works - I just took them with my phone (and the light made the flower look very white, but its more pink than white.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;@[member=\"racht33\"]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18070]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900178,"PostDate":1436539724,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>HI ladies,<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>I hope this works - I just took them with my phone (and the light made the flower look very white, but its more pink than white.)\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18070-afloral-before\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18070\/tn_gallery_282134_18070_29267.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='Calla'  width='75' height='75'  alt='Calla' id='tn_image_view_81575_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpgallery\/album\/18070-afloral-before\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Afloral (before)<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>4 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisesutherland@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.88.106.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424110087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsntobe","Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2259cbccbba93c73f0ed64c10b857fe4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Mrsntobe\"] they look very real!! WOW!! Do they feel real ? They may get a customer out of me with the great info you shared!! Thank you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900180,"PostDate":1436540211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282134\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282134-mrsntobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mrsntobe<\/span><\/a> they look very real!! WOW!! Do they feel real ? They may get a customer out of me with the great info you shared!! Thank you<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"32.211.202.237","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36d1b0c09b7d38a9cc298864319e1260","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"racht33\"] - and these were on closeout $9.99 for a dozen! :) &amp;nbsp;I couldn&#039;t be happier.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;They feel real - especially the inside of the flowers, the stems not so much but that&#039;s what wrap and floral tape is for! &amp;nbsp;The flowers are a little bit thicker than a real one, but even looking at them now, if I didn&#039;t know any better I would assume they were real.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Using promo code FB I also got an extra 10% off. &amp;nbsp;I choose their slowest shipping (cheapest) ordered late in the evening on Monday and it was at my door Thursday at noon (I&#039;m in CT.)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m sitting here wondering what else to order from them! LOL &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m not that into flowers so it was tough for me to want to spend tons of money on real flowers when I really don&#039;t get excited about it!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900182,"PostDate":1436541832,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281952\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281952-racht33\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">racht33<\/span><\/a> - and these were on closeout $9.99 for a dozen! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0I couldn't be happier.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They feel real - especially the inside of the flowers, the stems not so much but that's what wrap and floral tape is for! \u00a0The flowers are a little bit thicker than a real one, but even looking at them now, if I didn't know any better I would assume they were real.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Using promo code FB I also got an extra 10% off. \u00a0I choose their slowest shipping (cheapest) ordered late in the evening on Monday and it was at my door Thursday at noon (I'm in CT.)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm sitting here wondering what else to order from them! LOL \u00a0I'm not that into flowers so it was tough for me to want to spend tons of money on real flowers when I really don't get excited about it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisesutherland@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.88.106.146","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424110087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282134.jpg?_r=1441149164","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mrsntobe","Id":282134,"Name":"Mrsntobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"172.56.23.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86c331d695f11af53efc96c9eccadc96","RawContent":"@[member=\"Mrsntobe\"] this is great info! I&#039;m also on ct so shipping time will be great.  I started to browse the site and saw so many things I wanted!! Thanx for sharing again!","Attachments":[],"Id":1900199,"PostDate":1436564828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282134\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282134-mrsntobe\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Mrsntobe<\/span><\/a> this is great info! I'm also on ct so shipping time will be great.  I started to browse the site and saw so many things I wanted!! Thanx for sharing again!  \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>57 Guest","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422618588,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.187","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79371,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cba1061a420cf2e799fe3594518a936d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Those flowers are really pretty!! I took a l