{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.46.112.169","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a8edd94d6d53100e0ad9179e3082b32","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I can not see myself in flats\/ barefoot for my wedding. I wear heals\/ wedges everywhere and my FI is over a foot taller than me.&amp;nbsp;So I will be in wedges... I&#039;m hoping the sand ceremony wont be to bad but i think i can manage. The reception will be on concrete so that should be fine. And when else can i drop a ton on shoes and not feel bad about it?!?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If i was taller i would probably be barefoot for the ceremony thought. The beaded things for your feet are really cute!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1849782,"PostDate":1399842843,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I can not see myself in flats\/ barefoot for my wedding. I wear heals\/ wedges everywhere and my FI is over a foot taller than me.\u00a0So I will be in wedges... I'm hoping the sand ceremony wont be to bad but i think i can manage. The reception will be on concrete so that should be fine. And when else can i drop a ton on shoes and not feel bad about it?!?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If i was taller i would probably be barefoot for the ceremony thought. The beaded things for your feet are really cute!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kathyandethan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"96.46.112.169","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399260140,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277838.jpg?_r=1399427613","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KathyandEthan","Id":277838,"Name":"KathyandEthan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.192.65.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"90d55fa2c9a1cda0a2181f9d81737072","RawContent":"I hate heals so flip flops is my dream! Lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1853438,"PostDate":1401741788,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I hate heals so flip flops is my dream! Lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Jamie","Email":"lovinmylilone@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.192.94.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1400757982,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nybride525","Id":278074,"Name":"Nybride525","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3cab92d1bff7fdeb66139057fb7f07c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What&#039;s everyone&#039;s opinion on barefoot jewlery - a good idea or a tacky trend? I want to do it but I don&#039;t want to regret it.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856886,"PostDate":1403706497,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What's everyone's opinion on barefoot jewlery - a good idea or a tacky trend? I want to do it but I don't want to regret it.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lauramthistle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"24.34.236.241","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1391606556,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276518.jpg?_r=1394639305","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LauraM","Id":276518,"Name":"LauraM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4106a5ab4835fb81d6bbbb0b8dccb11","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"LauraM\"] &amp;nbsp;I think it depends on your feet, honestly. &amp;nbsp;If you have narrow\/nice feet, I think they can look beautiful. &amp;nbsp;I have bigger feet, so I don&#039;t think I&#039;d look that great in them. &amp;nbsp;Helps that I haven&#039;t really found many I like haha.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Has anyone tried these? &amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.thesolemates.com\/our-products\/solemates-high-heeler\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.thesolemates.com\/our-products\/solemates-high-heeler\/&lt;\/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;I wonder how they&#039;d work in the sand? &amp;nbsp;I kind of want to wear heels, due to the height difference as well, and haven&#039;t found any wedges I like! &amp;nbsp;Plus I want blue glittery shoes, and I doubt that blue glitter wedges have the same wow factor as blue heels (they might look pretty tacky actually, haha). &lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt;For instance, blue glitter heels:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.pumpsshirts.com\/wordpress\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/10\/Christian_Louboutin_Pump_Blue-300x225.jpg&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.pumpsshirts.com\/wordpress\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/10\/Christian_Louboutin_Pump_Blue-300x225.jpg&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Blue glitter wedges:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/lghttp.17106.nexcesscdn.net\/808773\/magento\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/image\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/s\/h\/shoes-wedges-op-cilo-34blue_2.jpg&#039;&gt;http:\/\/lghttp.17106.nexcesscdn.net\/808773\/magento\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/image\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/s\/h\/shoes-wedges-op-cilo-34blue_2.jpg&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The wedges look more like stripper shoes to me LOL&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856889,"PostDate":1403707736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276518\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276518-lauram\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LauraM<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I think it depends on your feet, honestly. \u00a0If you have narrow\/nice feet, I think they can look beautiful. \u00a0I have bigger feet, so I don't think I'd look that great in them. \u00a0Helps that I haven't really found many I like haha.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Has anyone tried these? \u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.thesolemates.com\/our-products\/solemates-high-heeler\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.thesolem...es-high-heeler\/<\/a> \u00a0I wonder how they'd work in the sand? \u00a0I kind of want to wear heels, due to the height difference as well, and haven't found any wedges I like! \u00a0Plus I want blue glittery shoes, and I doubt that blue glitter wedges have the same wow factor as blue heels (they might look pretty tacky actually, haha). <\/p>\n<br \/><p>For instance, blue glitter heels:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.pumpsshirts.com\/wordpress\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/10\/Christian_Louboutin_Pump_Blue-300x225.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.pumpsshir...lue-300x225.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Blue glitter wedges:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/lghttp.17106.nexcesscdn.net\/808773\/magento\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/image\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/s\/h\/shoes-wedges-op-cilo-34blue_2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/lghttp.17106....lo-34blue_2.jpg<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The wedges look more like stripper shoes to me LOL<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387570652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17db0350bda69fcaa925a909ef93fa04","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1856889\" timestamp=\"1403722136\"]\n@[member=\"LauraM\"]  I think it depends on your feet, honestly.  If you have narrow\/nice feet, I think they can look beautiful.  I have bigger feet, so I don&#039;t think I&#039;d look that great in them.  Helps that I haven&#039;t really found many I like haha.\n \n \nHas anyone tried these?  [url=\"https:\/\/www.thesolemates.com\/our-products\/solemates-high-heeler\/\"]https:\/\/www.thesolemates.com\/our-products\/solemates-high-heeler\/[\/url]  I wonder how they&#039;d work in the sand?  I kind of want to wear heels, due to the height difference as well, and haven&#039;t found any wedges I like!  Plus I want blue glittery shoes, and I doubt that blue glitter wedges have the same wow factor as blue heels (they might look pretty tacky actually, haha). \nFor instance, blue glitter heels:\n[url=\"http:\/\/www.pumpsshirts.com\/wordpress\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/10\/Christian_Louboutin_Pump_Blue-300x225.jpg\"]http:\/\/www.pumpsshirts.com\/wordpress\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/10\/Christian_Louboutin_Pump_Blue-300x225.jpg[\/url]\n \nBlue glitter wedges:\n[url=\"http:\/\/lghttp.17106.nexcesscdn.net\/808773\/magento\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/image\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/s\/h\/shoes-wedges-op-cilo-34blue_2.jpg\"]http:\/\/lghttp.17106.nexcesscdn.net\/808773\/magento\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/image\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/s\/h\/shoes-wedges-op-cilo-34blue_2.jpg[\/url]\n \n \nThe wedges look more like stripper shoes to me LOL[\/quote]I have worn the heel covers before. But I wore them at a wedding where we had to walk through grass, they worked really well, but I don&#039;t think they would really work in the sand, you would still sink into it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1856891,"PostDate":1403709365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 25 June 2014 - 02:48 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276518\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276518-lauram\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LauraM<\/span><\/a> \u00a0I think it depends on your feet, honestly. \u00a0If you have narrow\/nice feet, I think they can look beautiful. \u00a0I have bigger feet, so I don't think I'd look that great in them. \u00a0Helps that I haven't really found many I like haha.<br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nHas anyone tried these? \u00a0<a href='https:\/\/www.thesolemates.com\/our-products\/solemates-high-heeler\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.thesolem...es-high-heeler\/<\/a> \u00a0I wonder how they'd work in the sand? \u00a0I kind of want to wear heels, due to the height difference as well, and haven't found any wedges I like! \u00a0Plus I want blue glittery shoes, and I doubt that blue glitter wedges have the same wow factor as blue heels (they might look pretty tacky actually, haha). <br>\nFor instance, blue glitter heels:<br><a href='http:\/\/www.pumpsshirts.com\/wordpress\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/10\/Christian_Louboutin_Pump_Blue-300x225.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.pumpsshir...lue-300x225.jpg<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nBlue glitter wedges:<br><a href='http:\/\/lghttp.17106.nexcesscdn.net\/808773\/magento\/media\/catalog\/product\/cache\/1\/image\/9df78eab33525d08d6e5fb8d27136e95\/s\/h\/shoes-wedges-op-cilo-34blue_2.jpg' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/lghttp.17106....lo-34blue_2.jpg<\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThe wedges look more like stripper shoes to me LOL<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI have worn the heel covers before. But I wore them at a wedding where we had to walk through grass, they worked really well, but I don't think they would really work in the sand, you would still sink into it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candle_23@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"66.222.215.154","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1375747301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272291.jpg?_r=1388954341","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"candle23","Id":272291,"Name":"candle23","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73951,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba53f1c56c47d17f1c0df98723b24b30","RawContent":"[quote name=\"candle23\" post=\"1856891\" timestamp=\"1403723765\"]\nI have worn the heel covers before. But I wore them at a wedding where we had to walk through grass, they worked really well, but I don&#039;t think they would really work in the sand, you would still sink into it![\/quote]\n\nThat&#039;s what I&#039;m reading online!  Guess I&#039;ll find some cute white wedges for the ceremony, and save the heels for the reception!","Attachments":[],"Id":1856894,"PostDate":1403710831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>candle23, on 25 June 2014 - 03:16 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I have worn the heel covers before. But I wore them at a wedding where we had to walk through grass, they worked really well, but I don't think they would really work in the sand, you would still sink into it!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's what I'm reading online! \u00a0Guess I'll find some cute white wedges for the ceremony, and save the heels for the reception!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\