> User dl0478 (284081)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"705ba507e8a318d9f4d49be89f67494f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1867772\" timestamp=\"1408504938\"]\nI find I decided to do a lot of things I originally said I wouldn&#039;t.... like splurge on all the extras, but the more I thought about it the more I was like &#039;this is only one day and what&#039;s $200 at the end of it&#039; LOL  or maybe that&#039;s because fiance kept saying that to me when I was being a cheap skate! lol! \n\nI am most definitely wearing it as it&#039;s my something blue, but after that who knows! I want to keep it though so it ain&#039;t being tossed.[\/quote]\nThat&#039;s more my fianc\u00e8&#039;s attitude than it is mine loll But I&#039;m slowly loosening up about things and agreeing to do things since this is just one special day exactly for that same reason - my fianc\u00e9 says I&#039;m worrying too much about money and need to just relax....so I&#039;m trying loll I&#039;ll probably get one for just for us....not to toss lol \n\n@[member=\"LauraM\"] - Agreed! That&#039;s the beauty of it - do whatever you&#039;re comfortable doing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1867917,"PostDate":1408569550,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 19 August 2014 - 11:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I find I decided to do a lot of things I originally said I wouldn't.... like splurge on all the extras, but the more I thought about it the more I was like 'this is only one day and what's $200 at the end of it' LOL \u00a0or maybe that's because fiance kept saying that to me when I was being a cheap skate! lol!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am most definitely wearing it as it's my something blue, but after that who knows! I want to keep it though so it ain't being tossed.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's more my fianc\u00e8's attitude than it is mine loll But I'm slowly loosening up about things and agreeing to do things since this is just one special day exactly for that same reason - my fianc\u00e9 says I'm worrying too much about money and need to just relax....so I'm trying loll I'll probably get one for just for us....not to toss lol\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"276518\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/276518-lauram\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">LauraM<\/span><\/a> - Agreed! That's the beauty of it - do whatever you're comfortable doing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"limaldo96@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.196.202.228","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406462117,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279182.jpg?_r=1406769983","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":168,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Lia33","Id":279182,"Name":"Lia33","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.205.227.103","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"84cc02a561041a39cebe559e11adbe2b","RawContent":"Glad to hear there are others not partaking in this. My FI is not comfortable doing this in front of my dad and I have to say I don&#039;t blame him.","Attachments":[],"Id":1868372,"PostDate":1408755523,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Glad to hear there are others not partaking in this. My FI is not comfortable doing this in front of my dad and I have to say I don't blame him.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"holly_youngquist@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"108.215.245.97","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399555622,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"hyoungquist","Id":277896,"Name":"hyoungquist","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"524a861a88b927959ac5bea6c3e2aca0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I might wear a garter (to incorporate my something blue), but we are foregoing the whole garter toss part.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869120,"PostDate":1409062512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I might wear a garter (to incorporate my something blue), but we are foregoing the whole garter toss part.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jolie.vidal@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.143.69.5","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1408543857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"BrideToBeJolie","Id":279500,"Name":"BrideToBeJolie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.69.200.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc4f27b79ae51fea033df74bf8092061","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I told my fiance last night that I didn&#039;t want to do a garter toss and he totally agreed! phew!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also considering forgoing the bouquet toss too. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869151,"PostDate":1409068238,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I told my fiance last night that I didn't want to do a garter toss and he totally agreed! phew!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also considering forgoing the bouquet toss too. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399414202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.91.107.162","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fffcd0e8153496be8c607761831b1d10","RawContent":"I totally want to wear a garter but I think I&#039;d be too embarrassed to get my fianc\u00e9 to take it off in front of everyone haha! My dress is too tight and I&#039;d feel like I&#039;d almost have to lift it all the way up to get to the garter \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1869187,"PostDate":1409076620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I totally want to wear a garter but I think I'd be too embarrassed to get my fianc\u00e9 to take it off in front of everyone haha! My dress is too tight and I'd feel like I'd almost have to lift it all the way up to get to the garter <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359748704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1442890536","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fe8813baf2dfb2ef5ad211d49213d2f1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am doing a garter- only because I wanted to surprise my fiance with one made of his favorite \"footy\" team - it has a little charm and everything. I got my from theweddinggarter.com - professional, fast, and awesome! I feel like I cant really surprise him much because we arent doing a grooms cake&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My friend also gave me a garter from Agent Provacateur (fancy lingerie store)- i feel bad not wearing it but i had in mind to design one&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;but there is no way that he is going to be crawling up my dress in front of my dad to get it...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869272,"PostDate":1409084636,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am doing a garter- only because I wanted to surprise my fiance with one made of his favorite \"footy\" team - it has a little charm and everything. I got my from theweddinggarter.com - professional, fast, and awesome! I feel like I cant really surprise him much because we arent doing a grooms cake<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My friend also gave me a garter from Agent Provacateur (fancy lingerie store)- i feel bad not wearing it but i had in mind to design one<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>but there is no way that he is going to be crawling up my dress in front of my dad to get it...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadia.bozanich@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.112.200.126","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1406722272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"nadiakat17","Id":279229,"Name":"nadiakat17","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"23.16.108.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9fecff46da2a55ae7101e333c906cc90","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I decided we are not going to have a garter. Everyone except 3 guests that are going are all married. So no point.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1869382,"PostDate":1409148648,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My fiance and I decided we are not going to have a garter. Everyone except 3 guests that are going are all married. So no point.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Our Awesome <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wevideo.com\/hub\/#media\/ci\/113639543'>Video<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Our <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/itslegendary2014.wix.com\/fasa'>Website<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/'>Riu Palace Riviera Maya Planning Thread<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1864158'>Pre-wedding photos<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1905375'>Pre-wedding photos Part II<\/a>,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878020'>OOT Baskets<\/a>, <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1878578'>Centrepieces<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1852686'>DIY - Giant Crepe Roses<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867378'>DIY - Hangers & Boutonnieres<\/a>,\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/?p=1867696'>DIY - Kissing Menu\/I Spy & Guestbook<\/a><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76802-elsas-arthurs-wedding-rprm-20141208\/page-6#entry1878023'>More DIYs - Passport to Riviera Maya, Bookmarks, Tumbler Inserts, Luggage Tags, Keycard Holder Inserts, Something Special for You Inserts<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"elsa_jam@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"23.16.109.98","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372273518,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270962.png?_r=1397000926","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Icis","Id":270962,"Name":"Icis","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.199.247.171","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"318b4a4e71a443675754c7d0de0d9ba8","RawContent":"Same here - everyone at my wedding aside from FI and my younger siblings will be engaged\/married so no garter or bouquet toss for us. \n\n\nI will still be getting a garter because it will be made with my alma mater colors w\/mascot pin and I think it will be great for pictures.\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1869397,"PostDate":1409154115,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Same here - everyone at my wedding aside from FI and my younger siblings will be engaged\/married so no garter or bouquet toss for us. <br><br>\nI will still be getting a garter because it will be made with my alma mater colors w\/mascot pin and I think it will be great for pictures.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n      