"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"823af38a42979a48a365e30e7d80446f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]niajs[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n What is the meaning?! I&#039;d like to wear one but it depends on the dress I get as I may choose a light one and it may show.[\/quote] \n[b] \n good quesstion... I don\u00b4t if it means something but I wouldn\u00b4t like mine to show either.... I\u00b4ll try and find out! [\/b]","Attachments":[],"Id":1288286,"PostDate":1284624240,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>niajs<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> What is the meaning?! I'd like to wear one but it depends on the dress I get as I may choose a light one and it may show.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <h3> <br \/> good quesstion... I don\u00b4t if it means something but I wouldn\u00b4t like mine to show either.... I\u00b4ll try and find out!\u00a0<\/h3>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Nan and Erik forever!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nansimoni@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1276181778,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229058.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":178,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nan","Id":229058,"Name":"Nan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"548b36c66b290e972ff4d97ebfdc8491","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;\"&gt;Throwing the garter began in France when pieces of the bridal attire were considered lucky. The bride would throw the garter to the guests at the wedding and whoever caught it could expect good luck. In the United States, the groom traditionally removes the garter from the bride and throws it to the unmarried men. The man who catches it is thought to be the next to marry.&lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" title=\"\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1290080,"PostDate":1284798998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:16px\">Throwing the garter began in France when pieces of the bridal attire were considered lucky. The bride would throw the garter to the guests at the wedding and whoever caught it could expect good luck. In the United States, the groom traditionally removes the garter from the bride and throws it to the unmarried men. The man who catches it is thought to be the next to marry.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" title=\"\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Nan and Erik forever!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nansimoni@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1276181778,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229058.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":178,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nan","Id":229058,"Name":"Nan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30f6832d8933a35012f99b6ca0df9d82","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I really don&#039;t want to do the garter and bouquet toss. My fiance really seems disappointed about this so i&#039;m trying to come up with other ideas in the place. I like the idea of having a dance and eliminating couples until we get to the couple that has been together the longest and giving them a bouquet (not my bouquet of course lol). Does anyone have any ideas I could use in place of the garter?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1565597,"PostDate":1326052345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I really don't want to do the garter and bouquet toss. My fiance really seems disappointed about this so i'm trying to come up with other ideas in the place. I like the idea of having a dance and eliminating couples until we get to the couple that has been together the longest and giving them a bouquet (not my bouquet of course lol). Does anyone have any ideas I could use in place of the garter?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jillygrl124@aol.com","IpAddress":"68.194.190.80","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319544380,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247053.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jillybeans127","Id":247053,"Name":"jillybeans127","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3442f7956a58ee8eb1f6e8911a4a5936","RawContent":"I have seen the &#039;throwing out the groom&#039;s little black book&#039; thing, to all his single friends. It would not work in my case, but the couple I know who did that filled in the names of every single girl they knew in the book. Not sure if it ever got used or not; I think that might offend some too, but it worked for them. \n \n I would really love to do a bouquet and garter toss. I just don&#039;t see it working for us. We will probably have a small group, and I am not sure if anyone there will be single with the exception of my sister and brothers, and they surely do not want my garter! I am kind of disappointed, but maybe we will do one at our AHR. Hope so! I love traditions, even the cheesy ones! \n \n Regardless, I will probably wear one anyway, even if it is just putting it on at the end of the night for FI to find. He would love it! \n \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jillybeans127[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I really don&#039;t want to do the garter and bouquet toss. My fiance really seems disappointed about this so i&#039;m trying to come up with other ideas in the place. I like the idea of having a dance and eliminating couples until we get to the couple that has been together the longest and giving them a bouquet (not my bouquet of course lol). Does anyone have any ideas I could use in place of the garter?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1565723,"PostDate":1326071734,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have seen the 'throwing out the groom's little black book' thing, to all his single friends. It would not work in my case, but the couple I know who did that filled in the names of every single girl they knew in the book. Not sure if it ever got used or not; I think that might offend some too, but it worked for them.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would really love to do a bouquet and garter toss. I just don't see it working for us. We will probably have a small group, and I am not sure if anyone there will be single with the exception of my sister and brothers, and they surely do not want my garter! I am kind of disappointed, but maybe we will do one at our AHR. Hope so! I love traditions, even the cheesy ones!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Regardless, I will probably wear one anyway, even if it is just putting it on at the end of the night for FI to find. He would love it!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jillybeans127<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I really don't want to do the garter and bouquet toss. My fiance really seems disappointed about this so i'm trying to come up with other ideas in the place. I like the idea of having a dance and eliminating couples until we get to the couple that has been together the longest and giving them a bouquet (not my bouquet of course lol). Does anyone have any ideas I could use in place of the garter?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"krys85418@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.181.124.120","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1301859312,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238489.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Peach","Id":238489,"Name":"Peach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0b9fad397a43be9e3b869e226e76981b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes i will be wearing a garter.&amp;nbsp; Its a New York Giants one because my fiance is a die hard fan and it is also my something blue! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1565752,"PostDate":1326095341,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes i will be wearing a garter.\u00a0 Its a New York Giants one because my fiance is a die hard fan and it is also my something blue! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Kristensr1129@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311535430,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242718.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kristen6212","Id":242718,"Name":"kristen6212","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e60950d96032667c97f4dad75cc89d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I had one made on Esty from our alma mater (we graduated from the same university). I won&#039;t be tossing it though. Just wearing it for fun and will put it in our office with all of the rest of our college stuff later.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1567576,"PostDate":1326402884,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I had one made on Esty from our alma mater (we graduated from the same university). I won't be tossing it though. Just wearing it for fun and will put it in our office with all of the rest of our college stuff later.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"llopez224@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316347218,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245479.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lolo411","Id":245479,"Name":"lolo411","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8666b9ea6d1b4033d1524f69f121d1ae","RawContent":"We&#039;re looking into Steelers garter for our big day...diehard fans of the black and gold.","Attachments":[],"Id":1568056,"PostDate":1326491045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're looking into Steelers garter for our big day...diehard fans of the black and gold.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mobear4@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1246829370,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219107.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cateyedcutie","Id":219107,"Name":"Cateyedcutie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c087e559c0a1614e49b8406a89dbf0cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n Thanks for posting this. I always wondered how the garter toss started.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Nan&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size: 16px\"&gt;Throwing the garter began in France when pieces of the bridal attire were considered lucky. The bride would throw the garter to the guests at the wedding and whoever caught it could expect good luck. In the United States, the groom traditionally removes the garter from the bride and throws it to the unmarried men. The man who catches it is thought to be the next to marry.&lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" title=\"\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1569941,"PostDate":1326904258,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Thanks for posting this. I always wondered how the garter toss started.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>Nan<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size: 16px\">Throwing the garter began in France when pieces of the bridal attire were considered lucky. The bride would throw the garter to the guests at the wedding and whoever caught it could expect good luck. In the United States, the groom traditionally removes the garter from the bride and throws it to the unmarried men. The man who catches it is thought to be the next to marry.<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/thewave.gif\" title=\"\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"julee.do@gmail.com","IpAddress":"216.110.87.22","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1308044958,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241123.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Julietisurs","Id":241123,"Name":"Julietisurs","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":156,"TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":110,"NextPage":120,"PreviousPage":100,"LastPage":150},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
