{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d9a54ea848e44985185db13760dfd2d","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]hat0112[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [font=arial][color=black][size=2]I plan on wearing a garter, but we aren&#039;t doing the bouquet or garter toss. My FI and I had a bad experience at a wedding during that and vowed to never participate in it again. [\/size][\/color][\/font] \n   \n   \n [font=arial][color=black][size=2]Now I did buy a garter, but I have thick thighs (from dancing for 12 years) so I will only wear it if I lose some more weight and I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t feel like it is going to cut off my circulation. [\/size][\/color][\/font][\/quote] \n \n You so need to explain the bad experience with a garter toss!","Attachments":[],"Id":1251097,"PostDate":1281573424,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>hat0112<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: arial\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\">I plan on wearing a garter, but we aren't doing the bouquet or garter toss. My FI and I had a bad experience at a wedding during that and vowed to never participate in it again. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: arial\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\">Now I did buy a garter, but I have thick thighs (from dancing for 12 years) so I will only wear it if I lose some more weight and I don\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t feel like it is going to cut off my circulation. <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> You so need to explain the bad experience with a garter toss!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarakadow@yaho.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1265430469,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225370.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":129,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skadow","Id":225370,"Name":"skadow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73faa971d30921b809780c75c26875a6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]DWBride615[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I agree with a lot of the ladies on here about the garter toss being a little too sexy for a family affair, and I don&#039;t want people seeing the fabric under my dress either lol However, I do like including traditional events into the wedding (one being the garter toss), so I decided to change it up where I&#039;m not really included in it. Our family and friends, guests, are rather humorous and are all for good fun. I talked to the Best Man(obviously my FH&#039;s best friend, so it&#039;s not some unknown random person) about this already and he&#039;s all for it. \n   \n Here it goes: Instead of a garter removal and toss, FI will have to put the garter [i]ON [\/i]blindfolded. Of course, he&#039;ll think that&#039;s its me he&#039;s putting the garter on, but as soon as he&#039;s blindfolded...I&#039;m out of the chair and the BM will take my place (pant risen up to his knee and no shoe). It&#039;s the usual trick with a twist. I know he wouldn&#039;t take anything far b\/c of the family present, even if it really was me instead of BM. I just hope he doesn&#039;t really think that hairy leg is mine lol \n   \n My sister wanted the BM to go a step further and actually wear a cheap, perhaps ugly, white dress during this but I said no. Besides, I think the hysterical laughter would tip off my FI LOL \n   \n I&#039;ll be wearing a garter regardless, but there&#039;ll be a cheap one used for the blindfolded switch and my garter won&#039;t be seen by anyone else but my FH ;-)[\/quote] \n \n that is such a great idea, everyone will get a kick out of it!  You will have to let us know in your wedding review how it went!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1251184,"PostDate":1281602899,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>DWBride615<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I agree with a lot of the ladies on here about the garter toss being a little too sexy for a family affair, and I don't want people seeing the fabric under my dress either lol However, I do like including traditional events into the wedding (one being the garter toss), so I decided\u00a0to\u00a0change it up\u00a0where I'm not really included in it. Our family and friends, guests,\u00a0are rather humorous and are all for good fun. I talked to the Best Man(obviously\u00a0my FH's best friend, so it's not some unknown random person)\u00a0about this already and he's all for it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here it goes: Instead of a garter removal and toss, FI will have to put the garter\u00a0<em>ON <\/em>blindfolded. Of course, he'll think that's its me he's putting the garter on, but as soon as he's blindfolded...I'm out of the chair and the BM will take my place (pant risen up to his knee and no shoe). It's the usual trick with a twist. I know he wouldn't take anything far b\/c of the family present, even if it really was me instead of BM. I just hope he doesn't really\u00a0think that hairy leg is mine lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My sister wanted the BM to go a step further and actually wear a cheap, perhaps ugly, white dress during this but I said no. Besides, I think the hysterical laughter would tip off my FI LOL<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'll be wearing a garter regardless, but there'll be a\u00a0cheap one used for the blindfolded switch and my garter won't be seen by anyone else\u00a0but my FH ;-)<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> that is such a great idea, everyone will get a kick out\u00a0of it!\u00a0 You will have to let us know in your wedding review how it went!!!!!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>July 8, 2011, Couples Sans Souci Ocho Rios, Jamaica<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"chriswin441@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1224276089,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212304.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":67,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sunstarsmoon","Id":212304,"Name":"sunstarsmoon","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"426d4b4ceffa02590dbdec3e90f2564c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i am probably going to wear one, but good point about the whole \"showing under the dress\" my is also very light. but i am not tossing it. never really thought about the flower toss. but for sure having out first dance.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1251219,"PostDate":1281603998,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i am probably going to wear one, but good point about the whole \"showing under the dress\" my is also very light. but i am not tossing it. never really thought about the flower toss. but for sure having out first dance.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>July 2011<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10704;105\/st\/20110708\/e\/OUR+BIG+DAY%21\/k\/9c73\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...9c73\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ashleydetroit@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1253673348,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-221917.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashley1316","Id":221917,"Name":"ashley1316","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3456ea811524039ef06169b1b5eba1ff","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am using garter and doing the toss, but here in Mexico we have the friends of the Groom to \"cover\" the bride taking arms close and dancing around the bride and groom when he is taking the garter, so not too much things to show &lt;img alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" \/&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1251260,"PostDate":1281605944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am using garter and doing the toss, but here in Mexico we have the friends of the Groom to \"cover\" the bride taking arms close and dancing around the bride and groom when he is taking the garter, so not too much things to show <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" \/><\/span>.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ednamoram2@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1180465778,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207429.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":249,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"edna","Id":207429,"Name":"edna","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"612a96a830a7608f7fb152d48b034ea4","RawContent":"LOVE that idea...that is really cute!  Too bad you can&#039;t cue the audience in to keep their laughter silent...the BM in a wedding dress would be priceless! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]DWBride615[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I agree with a lot of the ladies on here about the garter toss being a little too sexy for a family affair, and I don&#039;t want people seeing the fabric under my dress either lol However, I do like including traditional events into the wedding (one being the garter toss), so I decided to change it up where I&#039;m not really included in it. Our family and friends, guests, are rather humorous and are all for good fun. I talked to the Best Man(obviously my FH&#039;s best friend, so it&#039;s not some unknown random person) about this already and he&#039;s all for it. \n   \n Here it goes: Instead of a garter removal and toss, FI will have to put the garter [i]ON [\/i]blindfolded. Of course, he&#039;ll think that&#039;s its me he&#039;s putting the garter on, but as soon as he&#039;s blindfolded...I&#039;m out of the chair and the BM will take my place (pant risen up to his knee and no shoe). It&#039;s the usual trick with a twist. I know he wouldn&#039;t take anything far b\/c of the family present, even if it really was me instead of BM. I just hope he doesn&#039;t really think that hairy leg is mine lol \n   \n My sister wanted the BM to go a step further and actually wear a cheap, perhaps ugly, white dress during this but I said no. Besides, I think the hysterical laughter would tip off my FI LOL \n   \n I&#039;ll be wearing a garter regardless, but there&#039;ll be a cheap one used for the blindfolded switch and my garter won&#039;t be seen by anyone else but my FH ;-)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1251810,"PostDate":1281624659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> LOVE that idea...that is really cute!\u00a0 Too bad you can't cue the audience in to keep their laughter silent...the BM in a wedding dress would be priceless!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>DWBride615<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I agree with a lot of the ladies on here about the garter toss being a little too sexy for a family affair, and I don't want people seeing the fabric under my dress either lol However, I do like including traditional events into the wedding (one being the garter toss), so I decided\u00a0to\u00a0change it up\u00a0where I'm not really included in it. Our family and friends, guests,\u00a0are rather humorous and are all for good fun. I talked to the Best Man(obviously\u00a0my FH's best friend, so it's not some unknown random person)\u00a0about this already and he's all for it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here it goes: Instead of a garter removal and toss, FI will have to put the garter\u00a0<em>ON <\/em>blindfolded. Of course, he'll think that's its me he's putting the garter on, but as soon as he's blindfolded...I'm out of the chair and the BM will take my place (pant risen up to his knee and no shoe). It's the usual trick with a twist. I know he wouldn't take anything far b\/c of the family present, even if it really was me instead of BM. I just hope he doesn't really\u00a0think that hairy leg is mine lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My sister wanted the BM to go a step further and actually wear a cheap, perhaps ugly, white dress during this but I said no. Besides, I think the hysterical laughter would tip off my FI LOL<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'll be wearing a garter regardless, but there'll be a\u00a0cheap one used for the blindfolded switch and my garter won't be seen by anyone else\u00a0but my FH ;-)<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277409137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30633174a129ac80dc3efc60f45a8a33","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I think we are going to wait until the AHR to do them both.&amp;nbsp; There will be a ton more single people as opposed to maybe the 2 in Jamaica that will be single!&amp;nbsp; lol!&amp;nbsp; Any maybe after the all-inclusive advantages&amp;nbsp;kick in, maybe they wont even be single!&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"18\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"24\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1251811,"PostDate":1281624801,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I think we are going to wait until the AHR to do them both.\u00a0 There will be a ton more single people as opposed to maybe the 2 in Jamaica that will be single!\u00a0 lol!\u00a0 Any maybe after the all-inclusive advantages\u00a0kick in, maybe they wont even be single!\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"18\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"24\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.bowen@state.mn.us","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277409137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229519.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":160,"PhotoHeight":120,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missy&eric2011","Id":229519,"Name":"missy&eric2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ab7e8bfcd0904af5198cd9192682461","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We dont do the garter toss in the UK - but it is still tradition to wear one - mine is the one my mum wore on her wedding day :-) &lt;img alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1251973,"PostDate":1281629848,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We dont do the garter toss in the UK - but it is still tradition to wear one - mine is the one my mum wore on her wedding day :-) <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" height=\"16\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheesy.gif\" title=\"\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Josie x<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"josietoms@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1265567994,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225407.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"josietoms","Id":225407,"Name":"josietoms","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"635d43521c1d9c3e83003e8823af44a5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I will be wearing a garter, but only because i bought one to match my lingerie for my wedding night. I googled what the meaning for the garter was the other night and was quite shocked.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1282811,"PostDate":1284055191,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I will be wearing a garter, but only because i bought one to match my lingerie for my wedding night. I googled what the meaning for the garter was the other night and was quite shocked.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/Fmezp1.png%5B\/img%5D%5B\/link%5D\">]<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"susan.haddy@yahoo.co.uk","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1255021857,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222461.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Susan'n'Dean","Id":222461,"Name":"Susan'n'Dean","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":