shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Gran Bahia Principe - Runaway Bay - February 22, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"akua420@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1270619423,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-227119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":161,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"akua420","Id":227119,"Name":"akua420","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3dcaf2f2dcb0ebb84629cf7c28b0b8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; No way, I think my legs are going to be hot enough in the dress so&amp;nbsp;I really&amp;nbsp;don&#039;t want him going up in there especially in front of other people!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1250872,"PostDate":1281555055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> No way, I think my legs are going to be hot enough in the dress so\u00a0I really\u00a0don't want him going up in there especially in front of other people!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lyndsayhamilton@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1269217410,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226646.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lyndsay_h","Id":226646,"Name":"lyndsay_h","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"675c618b809fd905848ff24ecd8c6bcd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I don&#039;t know...I am pretty sure I wont be doing a garter toss or bouquet toss but I still would like just because I guess...I found one on etsy but it&#039;s way beyond my price range ($85)...unless I get a really good deal on something else or someone gifted it to meI wouldn&#039;t splurge on it....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;  &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"il_fullxfull.162092441.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/119362\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1251031,"PostDate":1281566765,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I don't know...I am pretty sure I wont be doing a garter toss or bouquet toss but I still would like just because I guess...I found one on etsy but it's way beyond my price range ($85)...unless I get a really good deal on something else or someone gifted it to meI wouldn't splurge on it....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"il_fullxfull.162092441.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/119362\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"themagicspork@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1273473686,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228052.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bizzyangel","Id":228052,"Name":"bizzyangel","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f07086a411de5b2437272f76e41dd06","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I agree with a lot of the ladies on here about the garter toss being a little too sexy for a family affair, and I don&#039;t want people seeing the fabric under my dress either lol However, I do like including traditional events into the wedding (one being the garter toss), so I decided&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;change it up&amp;nbsp;where I&#039;m not really included in it. Our family and friends, guests,&amp;nbsp;are rather humorous and are all for good fun. I talked to the Best Man(obviously&amp;nbsp;my FH&#039;s best friend, so it&#039;s not some unknown random person)&amp;nbsp;about this already and he&#039;s all for it.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here it goes: Instead of a garter removal and toss, FI will have to put the garter&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;ON &lt;\/em&gt;blindfolded. Of course, he&#039;ll think that&#039;s its me he&#039;s putting the garter on, but as soon as he&#039;s blindfolded...I&#039;m out of the chair and the BM will take my place (pant risen up to his knee and no shoe). It&#039;s the usual trick with a twist. I know he wouldn&#039;t take anything far b\/c of the family present, even if it really was me instead of BM. I just hope he doesn&#039;t really&amp;nbsp;think that hairy leg is mine lol&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My sister wanted the BM to go a step further and actually wear a cheap, perhaps ugly, white dress during this but I said no. Besides, I think the hysterical laughter would tip off my FI LOL&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;ll be wearing a garter regardless, but there&#039;ll be a&amp;nbsp;cheap one used for the blindfolded switch and my garter won&#039;t be seen by anyone else&amp;nbsp;but my FH ;-)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1251052,"PostDate":1281568469,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I agree with a lot of the ladies on here about the garter toss being a little too sexy for a family affair, and I don't want people seeing the fabric under my dress either lol However, I do like including traditional events into the wedding (one being the garter toss), so I decided\u00a0to\u00a0change it up\u00a0where I'm not really included in it. Our family and friends, guests,\u00a0are rather humorous and are all for good fun. I talked to the Best Man(obviously\u00a0my FH's best friend, so it's not some unknown random person)\u00a0about this already and he's all for it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here it goes: Instead of a garter removal and toss, FI will have to put the garter\u00a0<em>ON <\/em>blindfolded. Of course, he'll think that's its me he's putting the garter on, but as soon as he's blindfolded...I'm out of the chair and the BM will take my place (pant risen up to his knee and no shoe). It's the usual trick with a twist. I know he wouldn't take anything far b\/c of the family present, even if it really was me instead of BM. I just hope he doesn't really\u00a0think that hairy leg is mine lol<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My sister wanted the BM to go a step further and actually wear a cheap, perhaps ugly, white dress during this but I said no. Besides, I think the hysterical laughter would tip off my FI LOL<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'll be wearing a garter regardless, but there'll be a\u00a0cheap one used for the blindfolded switch and my garter won't be seen by anyone else\u00a0but my FH ;-)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>*~*Chelsea & Eric*~*<\/strong><span> {{<\/span><em>New wedding Date...Same Growing Love}}<\/em><span> October 13, 2012 (Rome, Italy)<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ccaballero615@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1278392940,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229918.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"DWBride615","Id":229918,"Name":"DWBride615","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":156,"TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":90,"NextPage":100,"PreviousPage":80,"LastPage":150},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
