 real use for it, and we&#039;re trying to save money.","Attachments":[],"Id":1220910,"PostDate":1279537817,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                initially i was planning on it, but from talking it over with FI doesn't look like i will...no real use for it, and we're trying to save money.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/v0lqm5.png\">http:\/\/dwdf.daisypath.com\/v0lqm5.png<\/a><br><br><span>58 people booked...and counting!!!<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"debbmach@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1256178465,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222770.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":93,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"debbmach","Id":222770,"Name":"debbmach","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd13eadbbd95d453fab9d64f8154beb4","RawContent":"Ok so im wearing a garter :\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i936.photobucket.com\/albums\/ad201\/nicyx\/BqlWjQCGkKGrHqUH-CEEumu4CURoBLwFjc4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Not for anything other than the novilty of it, i will wear it, give FI a sneaky peak at the wedding and then keep it afterwards :-)\n \n Dosent have to be expensive, i got mine from ebay for \u00a31.74 inc delivery. Like i say it really is just for the novilty aspect for us :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1221212,"PostDate":1279554597,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ok so im wearing a garter :<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i936.photobucket.com\/albums\/ad201\/nicyx\/BqlWjQCGkKGrHqUH-CEEumu4CURoBLwFjc4.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Not for anything other than the novilty of it, i will wear it, give FI a sneaky peak at the wedding and then keep it afterwards :-)<br \/> <br \/> Dosent have to be expensive, i got mine from ebay for \u00a31.74 inc delivery. Like i say it really is just for the novilty aspect for us :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicyx@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"92.18.169.72","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1262724640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224345.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nicyx","Id":224345,"Name":"Nicyx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2675ad80839aecee37227a75b82a4308","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Shoesiesluvr&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;MsSmith...im getting a NY Giants garter as well...im a giants girl so i hurriedly made that decision and bought it but then I started thinking that I really should have gotten his fave team for a garter since he&#039;ll be doing the removal hahaha therefore that leads in to my having a total of 5 garters lol&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I got a NY Giants garter as well. I bought the garters when we were planning the wedding here at home, so I will use them, but I don&#039;t know if we will do the toss or anything. I&#039;m undecided. I got the NY Giants one for the toss and a camo one to keep (as FI&#039;s a big hunter)!","Attachments":[],"Id":1222991,"PostDate":1279645915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Shoesiesluvr<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">MsSmith...im getting a NY Giants garter as well...im a giants girl so i hurriedly made that decision and bought it but then I started thinking that I really should have gotten his fave team for a garter since he'll be doing the removal hahaha therefore that leads in to my having a total of 5 garters lol<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I got a NY Giants garter as well. I bought the garters when we were planning the wedding here at home, so I will use them, but I don't know if we will do the toss or anything. I'm undecided. I got the NY Giants one for the toss and a camo one to keep (as FI's a big hunter)!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>Married the love of my life in April!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"erin82283@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1276026984,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228983.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Ellabaja1983","Id":228983,"Name":"Ellabaja1983","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b47d832ee169f7884ad572b5ce7f21b1","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;KelZavs20&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;I am wearing a garter .... just ordered it today from Garter Lady on Etsy!&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Which one did you order? I was looking at hers they are the best! So pritty.","Attachments":[],"Id":1222998,"PostDate":1279646127,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>KelZavs20<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">I am wearing a garter .... just ordered it today from Garter Lady on Etsy!<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Which one did you order? I was looking at hers they are the best! So pritty.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarakadow@yaho.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1265430469,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225370.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":129,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"skadow","Id":225370,"Name":"skadow","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4092f3db7ece24e91ba13501fc718cda","RawContent":"I brought one with me that I received for free from the bridal salon when I ordered my wedding dress. When I tried it on before we left for our DW, it felt too tight and uncomfortable, plus it was really itchy! Granted, it was probably a cheap garter. We didn&#039;t plan to do any of the traditional stuff like bouquet toss or garter toss, anyway. So, no garter for me!","Attachments":[],"Id":1223008,"PostDate":1279646326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I brought one with me that I received for free from the bridal salon when I ordered my wedding dress. When I tried it on before we left for our DW, it felt too tight and uncomfortable, plus it was really itchy! Granted, it was probably a cheap garter. We didn't plan to do any of the traditional stuff like bouquet toss or garter toss, anyway. So, no garter for me!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tesiakaczmarek@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1248837706,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219947.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"teshy1","Id":219947,"Name":"teshy1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecefaf34366fb65b33de54685bc25ec5","RawContent":"I have heard of girl&#039;s doing their something blue with a garter...I kinda don&#039;t want to take it off and throw it though if I do wear one..","Attachments":[],"Id":1225841,"PostDate":1279770335,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have heard of girl's doing their something blue with a garter...I kinda don't want to take it off and throw it though if I do wear one..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ldorcas21@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1274218075,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228344.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lsjhik","Id":228344,"Name":"lsjhik","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"872b93f3d211c2610aaf4c29e1144230","RawContent":"Probably not. I think I would feel awkward doing a garter toss even know I know it&#039;s a tradition.","Attachments":[],"Id":1226386,"PostDate":1279811212,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Probably not. I think I would feel awkward doing a garter toss even know I know it's a tradition.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/t\/w7NSnHf\/weight.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...nHf\/weight.png<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20110510\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/fd0b\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...fd0b\/event.png<\/a><br><br><br><strong>27 booked...and counting!!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"fanfia@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"167.92.67.10","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1262802146,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-224382.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":92,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bikegirl","Id":224382,"Name":"bikegirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8a5f99b4d981ecd5aa3296103636c7c5","RawContent":"I just bought a garter with two college teams since my fiance and I went to rival universities. Cost was $14.99 + $4.50 S\/H.\n \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.funweddingthings.com\/item_786\/TEAM-RIVALRY-Bridal-Wedding-Garter--Pick-Your-Two-Sports-Teams-or-Schools.htm\"&gt;Sports Team Rivalry Wedding Garter House Divided&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I doubt we will end up tossing the garter because I am wearing a mermaid dress and that could lead to some difficulties in the groom kneeling and pulling it off during the ceremony (take a moment for a mental image). I hate to think this way, but if it is a hot day in Mexico there is also a good chance the garter could be a little sweaty :-)","Attachments":[],"Id":1226463,"PostDate":1279813488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just bought a garter with two college teams since my fiance and I went to rival universities. Cost was $14.99 + $4.50 S\/H.<br \/> <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.funweddingthings.com\/item_786\/TEAM-RIVALRY-Bridal-Wedding-Garter--Pick-Your-Two-Sports-Teams-or-Schools.htm' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Sports Team Rivalry Wedding Garter House Divided<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I doubt we will end up tossing the garter because I am wearing a mermaid dress and that could lead to some difficulties in the groom kneeling and pulling it off during the ceremony (take a moment for a mental image). I hate to think this way, but if it is a hot day in Mexico there is also a good chance the garter could be a little sweaty :-)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"clgriffi7@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1276111330,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229026.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"clgriffi7","Id":229026,"Name":"clgriffi7","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb089dcbd810494bfd30a3e418b0cc76","RawContent":"I&#039;m wearing one, not to throw or anything though.","Attachments":[],"Id":1229053,"PostDate":1279935634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm wearing one, not to throw or anything though.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmorency21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"146.121.23.2","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1275338046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228718.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lisa203","Id":228718,"Name":"lisa203","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":156,"TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":150},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value"