"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37147489a1983f7384a4c7d65b910382","RawContent":"I am wearing a garter .... just ordered it today from Garter Lady on Etsy!","Attachments":[],"Id":1210911,"PostDate":1278701205,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am wearing a garter .... just ordered it today from Garter Lady on Etsy!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelzavs20@msn.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1246920085,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219162.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"KelZavs20","Id":219162,"Name":"KelZavs20","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1cf3190a31365d714daced17dc933a2e","RawContent":"I just got mine off of Etsy too - Peterene... she was awesome!! My FI is a huge Batman fan (the old batman - not the new stuff). Peterene worked so hard finding the right pictures and colours and it is amazing!!! She was terrific and so is the garter. \n I cant wait until my FI sees it! \n I am not going to throw it though -I dont love that tradition. I always thought it was a bit weird","Attachments":[],"Id":1211191,"PostDate":1278712747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just got mine off of Etsy too - Peterene... she was awesome!! My FI is a huge Batman fan (the old batman - not the new stuff). Peterene worked so hard finding the right pictures and colours and it is amazing!!! She was terrific and so is the garter. <br \/> I cant wait until my FI sees it! <br \/> I am not going to throw it though -I dont love that tradition. I always thought it was a bit weird\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;130\/st\/20100730\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/f4e8\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...f4e8\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"briouxt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1249319181,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220119.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":211,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dawnkyeknod","Id":220119,"Name":"dawnkyeknod","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50e0ca20f4de4eec07de2497ebb6812b","RawContent":"Just out of curiosity....what is the meaning behind the tradition? And why wear if you aren&#039;t going to throw it?? Just to have it as a keep sake?\n I hope that doesn&#039;t offend anyone, I&#039;m just not sure I get the point if nobody is going to see it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1211206,"PostDate":1278713189,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just out of curiosity....what is the meaning behind the tradition? And why wear if you aren't going to throw it?? Just to have it as a keep sake?<br \/> I hope that doesn't offend anyone, I'm just not sure I get the point if nobody is going to see it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0129.jpg\">http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v3...ustin_0129.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=219&title=112109-Natalia-Justin-Aventura-Spa-Palace-Photos-by-Sol-and-Vincent\">Pro Wedding Slideshow (by DelSol Photography)<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nakassah@uncc.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1241407920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217263.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NaM","Id":217263,"Name":"NaM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"Sh