l":"thinkthink98@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1273370226,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-228024.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*tinkertoy*","Id":228024,"Name":"*tinkertoy*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f468b79fd6330afad153c29541206a9d","RawContent":"We did all of it! I wore my garter all day and it didn&#039;t slip at all.\n \n My Wake Forest garter:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0018.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Tossing the flowers (for those who don&#039;t want to ruin their bouqet, you can take a BM&#039;s since they are usually smaller or ask your WC to have a special &amp;quot;tossing&amp;quot; one made that is a mini version of your own bouqet or just a few flowers tied together):\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0640.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And the garter toss:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0649.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1209353,"PostDate":1278611545,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We did all of it! I wore my garter all day and it didn't slip at all.<br \/> <br \/> My Wake Forest garter:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0018.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Tossing the flowers (for those who don't want to ruin their bouqet, you can take a BM's since they are usually smaller or ask your WC to have a special \"tossing\" one made that is a mini version of your own bouqet or just a few flowers tied together):<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0640.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And the garter toss:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0649.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v321\/natalia0410\/NataliaJustin_0129.jpg\">http:\/\/img.photobucket.com\/albums\/v3...ustin_0129.jpg<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=219&title=112109-Natalia-Justin-Aventura-Spa-Palace-Photos-by-Sol-and-Vincent\">Pro Wedding Slideshow (by DelSol Photography)<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nakassah@uncc.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1241407920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-217263.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":80,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"NaM","Id":217263,"Name":"NaM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a03d2ed9e93bb430d9dbaff0cc9cd893","RawContent":"Thanks for the thread! I was thinking about if I were going to do the garter\/bouquet toss and you ladies have offered pros &amp;amp; cons of both sides... \n \n @ Nikkianddean &#8211; I like the idea of presenting your bouquet to your mom.\n \n @ Yari - I like the idea of tossing the bouquet to all the ladies.\n \n @ ErinB &#8211; I LOVE, LOVE, LOVE the idea of tossing the bouquet with loose flowers. This allows all women participating to get a flower and I can only imagine the BEAUTIFUL photo opp&#8230;\n \n Decisions, Decisions, Decisions...","Attachments":[],"Id":1209374,"PostDate":1278612312,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the thread! I was thinking about if I were going to do the garter\/bouquet toss and you ladies have offered pros & cons of both sides... <br \/> <br \/> @ Nikkianddean &#8211; I like the idea of presenting your bouquet to your mom.<br \/> <br \/> @ Yari - I like the idea of tossing the bouquet to all the ladies.<br \/> <br \/> @ ErinB &#8211; I LOVE, LOVE, LOVE the idea of tossing the bouquet with loose flowers. This allows all women participating to get a flower and I can only imagine the BEAUTIFUL photo opp&#8230;<br \/> <br \/> Decisions, Decisions, Decisions...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"iamalldiva@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277776255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229675.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Iamalldiva","Id":229675,"Name":"Iamalldiva","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a19ffa56c1c659a659515809917b297e","RawContent":"im totally wearing a garter...its something that ive never thought of NOT wearing for my wedding...ive actually bought about 5 already lol there are soo many cute ones! i cant decide...ill prob wear one for my BD shoot...wear my fave one for the one for FI to remove &amp;amp; keep and another one for him to toss...we&#039;ll see..","Attachments":[],"Id":1209386,"PostDate":1278612499,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                im totally wearing a garter...its something that ive never thought of NOT wearing for my wedding...ive actually bought about 5 already lol there are soo many cute ones! i cant decide...ill prob wear one for my BD shoot...wear my fave one for the one for FI to remove & keep and another one for him to toss...we'll see..\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><strong>He's the Ying to my Yang...the Peanut Butter to my Jelly....the Oreo to my Milk...the Cheese on my Pizza...the i to my Phone...the Cream in my Coffee...the Jiggle to my Jell-O...the Star in my Sky...He's my BFF & I married him on 09.25.2010<\/strong><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/thread\/64142\/shoesiesluvr-s-cindy-planning-thread\"><strong>My Planning Thread<\/strong><\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cposada12@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1267742211,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226165.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shoesiesluvr","Id":226165,"Name":"Shoesiesluvr","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c5a4d253e954f0dbfa5e2c9133887791","RawContent":"I&#039;m definitely wearing a garter, I&#039;m getting this Dolphins one off of etsy. \n &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/46346554\/miami-dolphins-inspired-wedding-garter\"&gt;MIAMI DOLPHINS Inspired Wedding Garter Set by GartersByKristi&lt;\/a&gt;\n \n I&#039;ve ended up only having 2 BM&#039;s instead of 3 and I had already ordered all the bouquets so I&#039;m just going to use the left-over one has my toss bouquet, I like the idea of having all the ladies be involved though because majority of the women at my wedding will all be married.","Attachments":[],"Id":1209390,"PostDate":1278612674,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm definitely wearing a garter, I'm getting this Dolphins one off of etsy. <br \/> <a href='http:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/46346554\/miami-dolphins-inspired-wedding-garter' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MIAMI DOLPHINS Inspired Wedding Garter Set by GartersByKristi<\/a><br \/> <br \/> I've ended up only having 2 BM's instead of 3 and I had already ordered all the bouquets so I'm just going to use the left-over one has my toss bouquet, I like the idea of having all the ladies be involved though because majority of the women at my wedding will all be married.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Veronica & Adam - May 6, 2011 - Dreams Tulum<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"watsonvl@my.hiram.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1248538747,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219820.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"vlynnw","Id":219820,"Name":"vlynnw","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2efa1197f2b08aa305c7157f5b000565","RawContent":"i bought a cute satin one from Michaels with a blue swaorvsky (sp??) heart shaped crystal. It was cheap, like $4 usd.\n and my friend got me one from the dollar store that I am going to decorate in the Houston Texan football team theme. \n he can toss that one. lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1209481,"PostDate":1278614736,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                i bought a cute satin one from Michaels with a blue swaorvsky (sp??) heart shaped crystal. It was cheap, like $4 usd.<br \/> and my friend got me one from the dollar store that I am going to decorate in the Houston Texan football team theme. <br \/> he can toss that one. lol.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Betty y Jose + 13 booked<\/span><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10732;6\/st\/20100731\/e\/Until+our+Wedding%21%21%21\/dt\/-1\/k\/498c\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...498c\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"bsf3685@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268676920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226461.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":151,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bsf&jpg","Id":226461,"Name":"bsf&jpg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37eb4e70a618eb967d5a3ed52c6231d8","RawContent":"I had one and brought it down and in all the commotion of the day when it came time to put in on I had no clue where it was and really didnt care to worry about it. Found it in the suitcase when I got home. It was one of those things lower on the priority list for me.","Attachments":[],"Id":1209717,"PostDate":1278620259,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I had one and brought it down and in all the commotion of the day when it came time to put in on I had no clue where it was and really didnt care to worry about it. Found it in the suitcase when I got home. It was one of those things lower on the priority list for me.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hahawryluk@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1221055369,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-211661.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dolfinluck","Id":211661,"Name":"dolfinluck","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":156,"TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPa