{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5ccb1e3f388077a111c3d5ebd20e0a6a","RawContent":"I will be doing the garter and bouquet toss, I think it&#039;s fun to see people go crazy trying to catch it!! We don&#039;t have many single guys, so I think we&#039;ll have all the guys join in for it. what I&#039;m not doing is when the guy who catches the garter puts it on the girl who catches the bouquet, I think that would be very uncomfortable for both parties involved!","Attachments":[],"Id":1203348,"PostDate":1278099531,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I will be doing the garter and bouquet toss, I think it's fun to see people go crazy trying to catch it!! We don't have many single guys, so I think we'll have all the guys join in for it. what I'm not doing is when the guy who catches the garter puts it on the girl who catches the bouquet, I think that would be very uncomfortable for both parties involved!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/ocuour7.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/ocuour7.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"michelle.dugan@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277855105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229722.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"chell44","Id":229722,"Name":"chell44","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0bd61237c97fc77196cf485f2edd34a4","RawContent":"I just wearing one for my FI and it will be a nice suprise for him later that day! It is aqua blue and white with a palm tree charm.","Attachments":[],"Id":1203437,"PostDate":1278103759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I just wearing one for my FI and it will be a nice suprise for him later that day! It is aqua blue and white with a palm tree charm.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"1234@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1268265154,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226346.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Snickers","Id":226346,"Name":"Snickers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"350c5e2880f0197e3b02afc730f33169","RawContent":"I wasn&#039;t planning on doing a bouquet or garter toss, but I ended up with 2 extra bridesmaid bouquets because 2 of my girls dropped out after I bought the bouquets so now I&#039;m going to use one for the bouquet toss. I finally found a garter that I like on etsy today. It&#039;s black &amp;amp; white with music notes and a black rosette.","Attachments":[],"Id":1203632,"PostDate":1278125437,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I wasn't planning on doing a bouquet or garter toss, but I ended up with 2 extra bridesmaid bouquets because 2 of my girls dropped out after I bought the bouquets so now I'm going to use one for the bouquet toss. I finally found a garter that I like on etsy today. It's black & white with music notes and a black rosette.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/4p0r2jk.png\">http:\/\/img.weddingcountdown.com\/ticker\/4p0r2jk.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"hunniebee724@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1244305672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218181.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hunniebee724","Id":218181,"Name":"hunniebee724","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47f0e4a5813014953f8d5c0c279c5133","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;skadow&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;Bump..\n \n Found this thread in a search. Any newer girls on the site wanna post if they are or not?\n \n I dont want to do the throw, but I was going to wear one with my dress cause i think i&#039;d feel sexy. Only this is...Do they stay up?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I didn&#039;t even think of that! I hope it stays up....I have pretty big thighs though so I don&#039;t think it would slide down. Maybe I should try walking around wearing it before the wedding lol.","Attachments":[],"Id":1203634,"PostDate":1278125529,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table