bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'll probably wear one as my something blue or new too.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sny115c8@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1267411632,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226043.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TanyonL","Id":226043,"Name":"TanyonL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bedad6db361a017575abd6e6093fc89e","RawContent":"Hi, \n Yes I am going to wear a garter. I am having one made from someone from etsy.com. But I am going to make a games so that all the males try to get it. The same with the flower toss.","Attachments":[],"Id":1203750,"PostDate":1278160627,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi, <br \/> Yes I am going to wear a garter. I am having one made from someone from etsy.com. But I am going to make a games so that all the males try to get it. The same with the flower toss.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"panda_a4@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1254902311,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-222412.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":226,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"loua4","Id":222412,"Name":"loua4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":16561,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"238748e7cd321bba8f6180fc09a6772f","RawContent":"I am not doing a garter or bouquet toss...I&#039;ve never been big on traditions, so why start now, lol. Besides, I think everyone attending our DW will be married. If DH really wanted to do either, I suppose we could do it at our AHR. Or maybe I could just wear the garter for DH and just not toss it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1203771,"PostDate":1278163823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am not doing a garter or bouquet toss...I've never been big on traditions, so why start now, lol. Besides, I think everyone attending our DW will be married. If DH really wanted to do either, I suppose we could do it at our AHR. Or maybe I could just wear the garter for DH and just not toss it.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Heather & Eric ~ May 5th, 2011 ~ Beaches 