oving the little umbrellas!!<br \/> <br \/> I havent found a really good inspiration pic yet, but I will post ithere once I do!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><em>Enjoying marital bliss since July 1st, 2010<\/em><\/div><\/div>","Email":"nat_5636@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1249244846,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220085.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nsbride2010","Id":220085,"Name":"nsbride2010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3356bb3562f5ce0fff23c6649b96cf4b","RawContent":"Would love to see some more pics on this thread...anyone have some good pictures of their table set up?","Attachments":[],"Id":937988,"PostDate":1259032365,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Would love to see some more pics on this thread...anyone have some good pictures of their table set up?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Rob and Lindsey<\/span><br><br><strong>24 Booked + Bride and Groom<\/strong><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.mywedding.com\/robandlindseypearson\">www.mywedding.com\/robandlindseypearson<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"lindsey.jensen@plexus.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1257540369,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223118.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JuneWeddingDreams","Id":223118,"Name":"JuneWeddingDreams","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73e2a3c822b6771577008b097202e725","RawContent":"here are a few from our Almost married reception. We did mini beach balls with everyones name and then their table number. You cant see them that great but you get the idea. Our photographer also got creative with my ring...\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611486237_45603721_33922077.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611136937_45603721_33922014.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/052.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":938051,"PostDate":1259033622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                here are a few from our Almost married reception. We did mini beach balls with everyones name and then their table number. You cant see them that great but you get the idea. Our photographer also got creative with my ring...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611486237_45603721_33922077.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611136937_45603721_33922014.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/052.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/55142\/future-mrs2010-tucks-beaches-t-c-review-long-with-pictures\">My Beaches T&C review<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f128\/meag-tucks-future_mrs2010-super-long-planning-thread-pic-heavy-53999\/\">My planning thread<\/a><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/f77\/tropical-imaging-review-pictures-future_mrs2010-tucks-55570\/\">Tropical Imaging Review w\/pics<\/a><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"future_mrs2010@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1244221179,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218156.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":68,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"*Meagan*","Id":218156,"Name":"*Meagan*","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3714087a8e69bf85d7755e3aacf2a274","RawContent":"Well I don&#039;t have pics yet but here is my idea: \n \n Have the Mexican blanket\/serape as a table runner:\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/images.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n I ordered these maracas and I am going to put a pair or two on each table tied together by raffia.\n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/fiesta_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n And in the middle have a photo holder similar to this (I am in the middle of making them) hold up our table names (events from when we have been together such as: graduation, engagement, trips, College Days, Love at first site) and pictures of those times. \n \n &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/bird-holder.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/&gt;\n \n Finally there will be tea lights all around that. I have an image in my head I hope it all comes out right!","Attachments":[],"Id":938091,"PostDate":1259034371,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Well I don't have pics yet but here is my idea: <br \/> <br \/> Have the Mexican blanket\/serape as a table runner:<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/images.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> I ordered these maracas and I am going to put a pair or two on each table tied together by raffia.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/fiesta_2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> And in the middle have a photo holder similar to this (I am in the middle of making them) hold up our table names (events from when we have been together such as: graduation, engagement, trips, College Days, Love at first site) and pictures of those times. <br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i804.photobucket.com\/albums\/yy330\/alkoch8\/bird-holder.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Finally there will be tea lights all around that. I have an image in my head I hope it all comes out right!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Annette.parrent@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1243991780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218061.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alkoch","Id":218061,"Name":"alkoch","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98fa93a978f17286906d07f3ba6b04a9","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;cogswellgray&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;i looove the umbrella place cards. i would totally do that, but for some reason I don&#039;t feel the need to tell people where to sit...hmmm&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I have been debating that too! We only have 35 people coming, so can&#039;t they figure that out for themselves?? I don&#039;t really want to have to do table cards\/#s either..","Attachments":[],"Id":938223,"PostDate":1259040534,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>cogswellgray<\/strong> <span rel='l