gresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/AHR%20Pics\/AHRPics007.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Our dessert table w\/ my DIY cupcake towers.<br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/AHR%20Pics\/AHRPics008.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/AHR%20Pics\/AHRPics009.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" \/><\/span><\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>This is so cute. What are the starfishes made out of? It's adorable.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10716;87\/st\/20100120\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/cc48\/event.png\">http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt...cc48\/event.png<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"butterflyf369@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1235327046,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-215141.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Butterflyf369","Id":215141,"Name":"Butterflyf369","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4fca4e4ac635c9c999d3fdc069437ca2","RawContent":"foxytv...we are also having a beach reception....how did your turn out? Did any of your guest have problem eating in the sand....were bugs a problem? Was there enough light?","Attachments":[],"Id":961154,"PostDate":1260646462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                foxytv...we are also having a beach reception....how did your turn out? Did any of your guest have problem eating in the sand....were bugs a problem? Was there enough light?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jennwobst@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1249947535,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-220402.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gettingmarried","Id":220402,"Name":"gettingmarried","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a8d166bd9c7db4d487629e515c845bf","RawContent":"there are some really good ideas-thanks ladies!","Attachments":[],"Id":961574,"PostDate":1260726750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                there are some really good ideas-thanks ladies!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaynreneewed@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1246714524,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-219082.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":88,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaynreneewed","Id":219082,"Name":"jaynreneewed","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3162c3ba64fd8ece1895056e3c26c915","RawContent":"&lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Butterflyf369&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;This is so cute. What are the starfishes made out of? It&#039;s adorable.&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;I bought some candy molds and made candy starfish w\/ chocolate and vanilla candy melts. Super easy and they were a huge hit!\n \n &lt;div style=\"margin:20px; margin-top:5px; \"&gt; &lt;div class=\"smallfont\"&gt;Quote:&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\"&gt;  Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;gettingmarried&lt;\/strong&gt; &lt;img class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"&gt;  &lt;div style=\"font-style:italic\"&gt;foxytv...we are also having a beach reception....how did your turn out? Did any of your guest have problem eating in the sand....were bugs a problem? Was there enough light?&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/td&gt; &lt;\/tr&gt; &lt;\/table&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;Oh, the beach reception was PERFECT. Everyone loved it!! No guests had any problems. There were no bugs. I think you can see in the pics that they added nice strings of lights around the reception area so lighting was not a problem as it got darker. It was the perfect ambiance. Not too bright, but a nice, soft glow of lights.","Attachments":[],"Id":961667,"PostDate":1260736913,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>Butterflyf369<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">This is so cute. What are the starfishes made out of? It's adorable.<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>I bought some candy molds and made candy starfish w\/ chocolate and vanilla candy melts. Super easy and they were a huge hit!<br \/> <br \/> <div  style=\"margin:20px\"> <div class=\"smallfont\">Quote:<\/div> <table cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"99%\"> <tr> <td class=\"alt2\" style=\"border:1px inset\">  Originally Posted by <strong>gettingmarried<\/strong> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"View Post\"><\/span>  <div  style=\"font-style:italic\">foxytv...we are also having a beach reception....how did your turn out? Did any of your guest have problem eating in the sand....were bugs a problem? Was there enough light?<\/div> <\/td> <\/tr> <\/table> <\/div>Oh, the beach reception was PERFECT. Everyone loved it!! No guests had any problems. There were no bugs. I think you can see in the pics that they added nice strings of lights around the reception area so lighting was not a problem as it got darker. It was the perfect ambiance. Not too bright, but a nice, soft glow of lights.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m161\/foxytv\/Slide1-7.jpg\">http:\/\/i104.photobucket.com\/albums\/m...v\/Slide1-7.jpg<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"scwinetastings@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1177642740,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207379.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"foxytv","Id":207379,"Name":"foxytv","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":151,"TotalPages":16,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":150},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
