e love: candles, maracas, bright colors, flowers, photos, cute place cards and signs....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Amelia+Brooks_W_0637.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765126\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Blossom+Mark_W_0491.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765128\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Christian+Stephanie_W_0021.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765130\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Danie+Nicolas_W_0617.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765132\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Kendell+Brek_W_0319.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765136\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"Amber+Stefan_W_0238.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765138\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Need more ideas??? Visit our site:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; line-height: normal; \"&gt;http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595916,"PostDate":1331911345,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are a handful of our personal favorite set-ups!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It's really all about the details....We love: candles, maracas, bright colors, flowers, photos, cute place cards and signs....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Amelia+Brooks_W_0637.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765126\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Blossom+Mark_W_0491.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765128\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Christian+Stephanie_W_0021.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765130\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Danie+Nicolas_W_0617.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765132\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Kendell+Brek_W_0319.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765136\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Amber+Stefan_W_0238.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765138\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Need more ideas??? Visit our site:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 12px\">http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog<\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175004840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b59c8671fcf24c5818bf09f640f1c56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Love the 1st pic using the shot glasses as the place card! Awesome idea...too bad I already choose to do starfish :(&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595922,"PostDate":1331911946,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Love the 1st pic using the shot glasses as the place card! Awesome idea...too bad I already choose to do starfish <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ssanzick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1295370669,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235711.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sharon99","Id":235711,"Name":"Sharon99","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e1183dfb08ed0a1cdd36ca9287c1732","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love the shot glasses, great idea for a Mexico wedding!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595935,"PostDate":1331913777,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love the shot glasses, great idea for a Mexico wedding!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Hard Rock Punta Cana May 12, 2012<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"cmontankb@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1303572912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239192.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LalaJ","Id":239192,"Name":"LalaJ","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0581d7ba5f2112fa7f650e5557d19021","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Matt, I&#039;ve been looking for dark plate chargers and blue linens just like in your picture second to the bottom. Do you have any idea who the couple worked with for rentals? Such great inspiration!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595987,"PostDate":1331923399,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Matt, I've been looking for dark plate chargers and blue linens just like in your picture second to the bottom. Do you have any idea who the couple worked with for rentals? Such great inspiration!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.diedalis@mac.com","IpAddress":"66.31.52.209","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312061186,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243005.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrspfafftobe","Id":243005,"Name":"mrspfafftobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c58b526bfaf08c04a84c56fe746dc00e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hola mrspfafftobe,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Love to inspire future brides-to-be : )&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do I have recommendations??...you bet I do!! This gorgeous wedding story was put together by a dear friend and devoted Wedding Planner in the Mayan Riviera area: &lt;strong&gt;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Hi Matt, I&#039;ve been looking for dark plate chargers and blue linens just like in your picture second to the bottom. Do you have any idea who the couple worked with for rentals? Such great inspiration!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/blockquote&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595992,"PostDate":1331924703,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hola mrspfafftobe,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Love to inspire future brides-to-be : )<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do I have recommendations??...you bet I do!! This gorgeous wedding story was put together by a dear friend and devoted Wedding Planner in the Mayan Riviera area: <strong><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Matt, I've been looking for dark plate chargers and blue linens just like in your picture second to the bottom. Do you have any idea who the couple worked with for rentals? Such great inspiration!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175004840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b6f9f4bbe05c0927b9478cab9b6c0d5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great post!!.. Keep up the pics ladies... :o)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1596446,"PostDate":1332114040,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great post!!.. Keep up the pics ladies... <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyrasco@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1329416272,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251499.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissBubbles205","Id":251499,"Name":"MissBubbles205","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16d0283fdc5b5dbaedf88b3b396938de","RawContent":"These are all so gorgeous!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Matt Adcock[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello Ladies, \n \n Here are a handful of our personal favorite set-ups!!! \n \n It&#039;s really all about the details....We love: candles, maracas, bright colors, flowers, photos, cute place cards and signs.... \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765126\/width\/800\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765128\/width\/800\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765130\/width\/800\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765132\/width\/800\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765136\/width\/800\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765138\/width\/800\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n Need more ideas??? Visit our site: [url=\"http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog\"][font=Helvetica][size=3]http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog[\/size][\/font][\/url] \n \n Happy Planning!! \n \n \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1596493,"PostDate":1332150151,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are all so gorgeous!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Matt Adcock<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are a handful of our personal favorite set-ups!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It's really all about the details....We love: candles, maracas, bright colors, flowers, photos, cute place cards and signs....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Amelia+Brooks_W_0637.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765126\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Blossom+Mark_W_0491.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765128\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Christian+Stephanie_W_0021.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765130\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Danie+Nicolas_W_0617.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765132\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Kendell+Brek_W_0319.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765136\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Amber+Stefan_W_0238.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765138\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Need more ideas??? Visit our site:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 12px\">http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog<\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aquarius193@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1308169959,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241201.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"principessa","Id":241201,"Name":"principessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc13f9f745f9c152e086e732b410dcb9","RawContent":"I also LOVE the tequila shot seating cards. Do you think a resort would set that up or do you think it would be too time intensive for them? I also like the idea of cocktails for seating cards too. [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/767808\/width\/600\/height\/469\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/767808\/width\/600\/height\/469[\/img][\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1596652,"PostDate":1332170750,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/st