ue lace panties size 7' id='sml_image_view_81154' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Platform White \"I do\" Flip Flops <\/strong>- $15<\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81155-platform-white-flip-flops-i-do-size-11-1\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_2378849.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Platform White Flip Flops I Do   Size 11 (1)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Platform White Flip Flops I Do   Size 11 (1)' id='sml_image_view_81155' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81156-platform-white-flip-flops-i-do-size-11-2\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_1072893.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Platform White Flip Flops I Do   Size 11 (2)'  width='113' height='200'  alt='Platform White Flip Flops I Do   Size 11 (2)' id='sml_image_view_81156' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div><strong>RSVP Envelopes<\/strong> - $5<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81157-rsvp-envelops\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18020\/sml_gallery_275696_18020_4464514.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='RSVP Envelops'  width='113' height='200'  alt='RSVP Envelops' id='sml_image_view_81157' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div><strong>Starfish Charms<\/strong> - 18 of them